<title>USA: Mauston, Wisc. $1.575 mln won by Bankers' Bank. [CORRECTED 17:33 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mauston, Wisc. $1.575 mln won by Bankers' Bank. [CORRECTED 17:33 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers' Bank (corrects from Robert W. Baird &amp; Co.), said it won $1.575 million of Mauston, Wisc., general obligation refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.80 (corrects from 4.90) percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 1,575,000	DATE: 10/08/96	NYC Time: 1200	CUSIP: 577659</p>
<p>ISSUER: Mauston							   ST: WI</p>
<p>ISSUE: G.O. refunding						  TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: NR/NR/NA							  BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: None							BANK QUAL: Y</p>
<p>DTD: 11/01/96							     SURE BID: Y</p>
<p>DUE: 12/1/97-06					     SR MGR: Bankers' Bank</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 06/01/97					   DOLLAR BID: NA</p>
<p>CALL: 12/1/03 @ par					 TIC 4.80</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 40 days					   ORDERS: NA</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: City Treasurer, Mauston</p>
<p>L.O.: Quarles &amp; Brady, Milwaukee</p>
<p>F.A.: Ehlers &amp; Associates, Minneapolis</p>
<p>LAST SALE: $1,090,000 5/21/91 @ 6.4598% NIC; 8yrs 0mos avg;BBI 6.94%</p>
